    "Almost there. Stand tall. Strong and controlled on the next one.": {
      "file": "0fd13a64a80cbe01.mp3",
      "duration": 5.03
    },
    "Arm circles. Stretch your arms out to the sides. Circle them forward, starting small and growing bigger. I'll tell you when to reverse.": {
      "file": "0838f8d4f9dbdb36.mp3",
      "duration": 9.07
    },
    "Butt kicks. Jog in place again, this time kicking your heels up toward your glutes. Stay quick and light, and let the arms swing.": {
      "file": "ac57a0b2a6aae088.mp3",
      "duration": 8.82
    },
    "Butterfly stretch. Sit tall with the soles of your feet together and knees dropped out. Hold your ankles and lean forward from the hips with a long, flat back. Breathe into it.": {
      "file": "bca5a55db692d380.mp3",
      "duration": 11.57
    },
    "Calf stretch. Step one foot back, keep that leg straight and the heel pressed down, front knee bent. Lean gently in until you feel the big calf muscle lengthen. About thirty seconds each side.": {
      "file": "7927747b79f8ef0d.mp3",
      "duration": 12.93
    },
    "Catch your breath. Shake out your legs.": {
      "file": "ca99709592371b01.mp3",
      "duration": 2.95
    },
    "Deep calf stretch. Stay in the same stance, but bend the back knee while keeping the heel down. This reaches the deep calf, the workhorse that pushes you off every step. About twenty-five seconds each side.": {
      "file": "a92a3431e835e263.mp3",
      "duration": 13.43
    },
    "Done. Nice work!": {
      "file": "0b8869b4c393366a.mp3",
      "duration": 2.1
    },
    "Figure-four stretch. Still on your back: cross one ankle over the opposite knee, then pull that thigh toward your chest until you feel the glute. Head and shoulders stay down. About thirty seconds each side.": {
      "file": "20c5f0d4bf5c653a.mp3",
      "duration": 13.43
    },
    "Find a wall. Move somewhere with a wall, rail or post to lean on.": {
      "file": "6ff4dc6f17df5caa.mp3",
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    "Find support. Move next to a wall, a post, anything you can hold on to.": {
      "file": "c036e89b91c85cb4.mp3",
      "duration": 5.5
    },
    "Get ready. Find a little space and stand tall. We start in fifteen seconds.": {
      "file": "1716b92f46ae3c4e.mp3",
      "duration": 5.5
    },
    "Get ready. Let your breathing settle. Easy does it, we take it slow.": {
      "file": "6c144c25238e2bf1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.75
    },
    "Hamstring stretch. Lie on your back and raise one leg, holding it behind the thigh with a soft knee. Draw it toward you until you feel the hamstring lengthen. Keep the other leg bent. About thirty seconds each side.": {
      "file": "d53afe744c87b581.mp3",
      "duration": 13.82
    },
    "High knees. Jog in place, driving your knees up to hip height. Land softly on the balls of your feet, quick but relaxed.": {
      "file": "177ea8bd1e464a34.mp3",
      "duration": 8.35
    },
    "Hip circles. Hands on hips. Circle your hips round like you're stirring a big pot. Start small and keep it smooth.": {
      "file": "cbb0471b51038436.mp3",
      "duration": 7.75
    },
    "Hip flexor stretch. Half-kneel with one foot forward and the back knee down. Tuck the tailbone under and shift the hips gently forward until you feel the front of the hip open. About thirty seconds each side.": {
      "file": "63afd2bc353eb4f6.mp3",
      "duration": 13.3
    },
    "Last one. Nearly there. Finish light.": {
      "file": "354505025f57e000.mp3",
      "duration": 3.13
    },
    "Last seconds. Three, two, one.": {
      "file": "e2b9781cd5470d83.mp3",
      "duration": 2.9
    },
    "Leg swings. Stand on one leg and hold the support. Swing the free leg forward and back like a pendulum, controlled, letting the range grow a little. We switch legs halfway.": {
      "file": "a23c7207440231ab.mp3",
      "duration": 12.1
    },
