    },
    "Shake it out. Loosen your shoulders and give your arms a good shake.": {
      "file": "1191472bfc7bbf1a.mp3",
      "duration": 4.5
    },
    "Side leg swings. Keep your hands on the wall and a slight forward lean. Swing one leg across your body and out to the side, sweeping a bigger arc each time. We switch halfway.": {
      "file": "4c89fc2d8246ed7a.mp3",
      "duration": 11.72
    },
    "Sit up tall. Come up to a seated position, back straight.": {
      "file": "d376026407041673.mp3",
      "duration": 4
    },
    "Squats. Feet shoulder-width apart. Sit back and down like you're reaching for a chair, chest up, knees over your toes. Rise and repeat at an easy pace.": {
      "file": "06feea094420e394.mp3",
      "duration": 10.7
    },
    "Stay by the wall. Turn to face the wall, both hands on it.": {
      "file": "ae599fe90ffe4bc7.mp3",
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    "Stay lying down. Keep the back long against the ground.": {
